  "description": "First self-contained variational derivation of all EFC perturbation-sector predictions from a single action principle. Derives field equations, performs linearisation in conformal Newtonian gauge, and extracts closed-form mu(k,z), Sigma(k,z), eta(k,z). Shows c_T=c exactly and predicts modified GW amplitude.",
